{"applicability":{"exclusions":[],"file_patterns":["docs/process/**/*.yaml"],"object_types":[],"workstreams":[]},"args":["object","get","POL-ONBOARD-001","--context","mcp"],"body":"**CRITICAL: Always use the CLI for object modifications.** Direct edits to instance YAML under `docs/process/` bypass integrity, content-addressed filenames, and caches.\n\n## Requirement\n1. Create, update, and delete instance/process data only via `zqk object create|update|delete` (or the appropriate domain command).\n2. Do not hand-edit YAML under `docs/process/` for instance data. Exception: `docs/process/_internal/` schema/config when CLI or tooling is unavailable — document why and follow up.\n3. After a CLI write, **commit the CAS rename with the work** (`POL-CODE-CAS-COMMIT-001`). Do not leave `complete` / `in_progress` hash YAML untracked.\n\n## Mechanical\nCapability gates (not Cursor `.mdc` prose) enforce CAS integrity:\n- `scripts/check-process-cas-commit-with-work.sh` — unstaged same-id rename pairs fail the commit (`POL-CODE-CAS-COMMIT-001`).\n- `scripts/check-cas-process-staged.sh` — staged hash filename must match blob sha256.\n- `scripts/check-process-casable-staged.sh` — staged instances must have left the draft plane.\n\nVendor IDE rules (`.cursor/rules/process-data-cli-only.mdc` and siblings) are **projections**. If they disagree with this object or `POL-CODE-CAS-COMMIT-001`, trust the kernel.\n","category":"workflow","command":"object get","created_at":"2025-01-02T00:00:00Z","created_by":"ACC-1785920548450214012-68b850c0","effective_date":"2025-01-02","enforcement":{"automated":true,"reminder_enabled":true,"review_required":false,"severity":"critical"},"examples":["✅ **Correct**: Use CLI for object operations\n```bash\nzqk object update BLI-655 --field status=in_progress\nzqk object create policy --file new-policy.yaml\n```\n","❌ **Incorrect**: Direct file edits\n```bash\n# Editing docs/process/backlog/BLI-655.yaml directly\n# This bypasses integrity mechanisms\n```\n"],"id":"POL-ONBOARD-001","kind":"policy","namespace_id":"zqk:kernel","origin_project":"zqk","origin_system":"zqk","policy_type":"standard","related_object_refs":["POL-CODE-CAS-COMMIT-001","GLS-1787100841603362000-7b751d5b","POL-CODE-CAS-TPM-GET-001"],"related_patterns":["doc_entry:AI_AGENT_ONBOARDING"],"review_date":"2025-07-01","schema_version":"2.0.0","status":"active","success":true,"title":"CLI for Object Operations","updated_at":"2026-08-19T01:49:25Z","updated_by":"ACC-1785920548450214012-68b850c0","version":"1.0.0","version_context":"default"}

