{"applicability":{"exclusions":[],"file_patterns":["**/*_test.go","**/*.go"],"object_types":[],"workstreams":[]},"args":["object","get","POL-ONBOARD-002","--context","mcp"],"body":"**Utilize a TDD process** while implementing ne...","category":"testing","command":"object get","created_at":"2025-01-02T00:00:00Z","created_by":"ACC-1785920548450214012-68b850c0","effective_date":"2025-01-02","enforcement":{"automated":false,"reminder_enabled":true,"review_required":false,"severity":"high"},"event_type":"required - must be specified","examples":["✅ **Correct**: TDD workflow\n```bash\n# 1. Write test first\n# 2. Run test (fails)\n# 3. Write implementation\n# 4. Run test (passes)\n# 5. Create test case object\nzqk object create test_case --file test-case.yaml\n```\n","❌ **Incorrect**: Implementation before tests\n```bash\n# Writing implementation first, then tests\n# This violates TDD principle\n```\n"],"id":"POL-ONBOARD-002","kind":"policy","namespace_id":"zqk:kernel","operation":"required - must be specified","origin_project":"zqk","origin_system":"zqk","policy_type":"requirement","related_patterns":["doc_entry:AI_AGENT_ONBOARDING"],"review_date":"2025-07-01","schema_version":"2.0.0","status":"active","success":true,"title":"Test-Driven Development (TDD) Required","updated_at":"2026-08-05T09:35:42Z","updated_by":"ACC-1785920548450214012-68b850c0","version":"1.0.0","version_context":"default"}

